### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuarioteste10@email.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

### Mudar o tema
PATCH http://localhost:3333/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "dark"
}

### Tema inválido (deve retornar 400)
PATCH http://localhost:3333/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "azul"
}

### Trocar a senha
PATCH http://localhost:3333/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Senha@123",
  "newPassword": "Nova@1234"
}

### Voltar para a senha original
PATCH http://localhost:3333/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Nova@1234",
  "newPassword": "Senha@123"
}

### Usuário comum tentando listar (deve retornar 403)
GET http://localhost:3333/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
